      en: ["200g shortcrust pastry (1 sheet), blind-baked", "200g smoked lardons or diced smoked bacon", "3 large eggs", "300ml double cream (min. 35% fat)", "60g Gruyère cheese, finely grated", "1/4 tsp freshly grated nutmeg", "salt and white pepper to taste", "butter for greasing"],
      es: ["200g de masa quebrada (1 lámina), cocida a ciegas", "200g de lardones ahumados o bacon ahumado en dados", "3 huevos grandes", "300ml de nata para cocinar (mín. 35% grasa)", "60g de queso Gruyère, finamente rallado", "1/4 cdta de nuez moscada recién rallada", "sal y pimienta blanca al gusto", "mantequilla para engrasar"],
