      en: ["2 cups short-grain white rice", "200g beef sirloin, thinly sliced against the grain", "1 medium courgette, julienned", "1 medium carrot, julienned", "200g baby spinach", "100g bean sprouts", "4 shiitake mushrooms, stems removed", "4 eggs", "4 tbsp gochujang (Korean chili paste)", "3 tbsp sesame oil", "2 tbsp soy sauce", "1 tsp sugar", "3 cloves garlic, minced", "Sesame seeds to garnish"],
