      en: ["500g full-fat Greek yogurt (strained overnight if possible)", "1 large cucumber (about 300g), grated and well squeezed", "2 garlic cloves, finely grated", "2 tbsp extra-virgin olive oil, plus a drizzle to serve", "1 tbsp fresh dill, finely chopped", "juice of half a lemon", "fine sea salt to taste"],
