      en: ["300 g Thai glutinous (sticky) rice, soaked in cold water at least 4 hours or overnight", "400 ml full-fat coconut milk", "80 g palm sugar (or light brown sugar)", "½ tsp salt", "1 pandan leaf, tied in a knot (optional, traditional)", "2 ripe yellow mangoes (Nam Dok Mai or Ataulfo), peeled and sliced", "2 tbsp toasted sesame seeds or split mung beans, for garnish", "1 tsp rice flour (optional, for thickening the salty topping)"],
